[selftest] sec5.6b rebut guard: conceded-then-rebutted W* first mention dropped -> C ('tiebreak_correction_first_C')
[selftest] alias miss -> UNRESOLVED_ALIAS ('bare_alias_miss')
[selftest] default -> NEITHER ('default_neither')
[selftest] alias table: Nur-Sultan / Democratic Republic of Congo / Antarctic Polar Desert resolve
[selftest] alias no-collateral: unrelated prose NEITHER; canonical unaffected; foreign alias still flagged
[selftest] aggregate: counts + n_changed + change_frac + confusion + MATERIALLY_RELABELED/STABLE
